1
00:00:00,602 --> 00:00:02,540
Di luar, ombak badai mengamuk.

2
00:00:02,710 --> 00:00:03,889
Di dalam pelabuhan,

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,840
kapal raksasa tetap tertambat.

4
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:07,005
Apa yang menahannya?

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,999
Pertahanan pertama ada jauh sebelum

6
00:00:10,019 --> 00:00:11,990
dermaga, yaitu breakwater.

7
00:00:12,160 --> 00:00:14,884
Tumpukan batu dan blok beton seperti

8
00:00:14,904 --> 00:00:16,555
tetrapod memecah ombak,

9
00:00:16,837 --> 00:00:18,814
jadi air di baliknya jauh lebih tenang.

10
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,799
Di dermaga, kapal diikat banyak tali

11
00:00:21,819 --> 00:00:24,569
ke bollard, dan tiap tali punya tugas.

12
00:00:24,740 --> 00:00:27,491
Tali haluan dan buritan menahan ujung kapal.

13
00:00:27,677 --> 00:00:29,973
Breast line menahan kapal agar tidak

14
00:00:29,993 --> 00:00:32,964
menjauh, dan spring line menahan kapal maju mundur.

15
00:00:33,153 --> 00:00:34,866
Di antara lambung dan dermaga,

16
00:00:34,886 --> 00:00:36,881
fender karet menyerap benturan.

17
00:00:37,403 --> 00:00:39,193
Tapi tali tidak dipasang lalu ditinggal.

18
00:00:39,386 --> 00:00:42,256
Saat air pasang surut dan muatan dibongkar,

19
00:00:42,277 --> 00:00:45,430
kapal naik turun, jadi tali terus disetel ulang.

20
00:00:45,930 --> 00:00:50,208
Saat badai, tali ditambah dan kapal tunda disiagakan.

21
00:00:50,508 --> 00:00:52,283
Kalau terlalu berbahaya,

22
00:00:52,347 --> 00:00:53,878
kapal bisa diminta keluar ke laut.

23
00:00:54,196 --> 00:00:56,652
Sebab tali yang putus bisa melecut dan mematikan.

24
00:00:57,168 --> 00:00:59,208
Kapal aman karena dijaga berlapis.

25
00:00:59,662 --> 00:01:00,958
Ini AUDIRA Explained.
